      "title": {
        "en": "Longstanding veterinary trust and family atmosphere"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight their long-term trust in Dr Brett Geffen, Dr Karan, and the nursing team, with several households attending the clinic across multiple generations. Reviewers describe the veterinary team as approachable, kind, and communicative, noting that practitioners take time to explain diagnoses clearly during routine check-ups and urgent visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and compassionate handling of pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently remark on the warm and patient manner shown towards their animals. Reviewers note that cats, energetic dogs, and elderly pets are handled with genuine affection and dignity. Multiple clients observe that nervous pets settle quickly in the consult rooms, making examinations and medical procedures significantly less stressful."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and thorough health outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report positive health outcomes for complex medical conditions, including dental surgeries, wound treatments, and chronic illness management. Clients appreciate the decisive medical care that helped older pets regain vitality. One reviewer reported an initial misdiagnosis regarding urinary symptoms, but clinical outcomes are praised widely."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do the veterinarians treat both cats and dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the practice routinely cares for feline and canine patients, providing wellness examinations, vaccinations, and surgical care."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the clinic perform dental cleanings and surgery?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients report successful dental treatments, soft-tissue surgeries, and routine preventative procedures."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are urgent or emergency walk-ins accepted?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic accommodates same-day urgent care and emergency presentations when possible, though advance contact is recommended."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is Boulevard Animal Hospital a family-run practice?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note the practice has served the local area across generations, led by Dr Brett Geffen following his father's tenure."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
